1
00:03:51,818 --> 00:03:57,818
How often do you find the right person?

2
00:07:43,636 --> 00:07:49,636
Once is a drama, music, romance film directed by John Carney.

3
00:11:35,454 --> 00:11:41,454
A vacuum repairman moonlights as a street musician and hopes for his big break.

4
00:15:27,272 --> 00:15:33,272
One day a Czech immigrant, who earns a living selling flowers, approaches him
with the news that she is also an aspiring singer-songwriter.

5
00:19:19,090 --> 00:19:25,090
The pair decide to collaborate, and the songs that they
compose reflect the story of their blossoming love.

6
00:23:10,909 --> 00:23:16,909
Guy, played by Glen Hansard.

7
00:27:02,727 --> 00:27:08,727
Girl, played by Markéta Irglová.

8
00:30:54,545 --> 00:31:00,545
Timmy Drummer, played by Hugh Walsh.

9
00:34:46,363 --> 00:34:52,363
Lead Guitarist, played by Gerard Hendrick.

10
00:38:38,181 --> 00:38:44,181
Bassist, played by Alaistair Foley.

11
00:42:30,000 --> 00:42:36,000
Eamon, played by Geoff Minogue.

12
00:46:21,818 --> 00:46:27,818
Once is a 2007 Irish 
romantic musical drama film
written and directed by John Carney.

13
00:50:13,636 --> 00:50:19,636
The film stars Glen Hansard and Markéta Irglová as two
struggling musicians in Dublin, Ireland.

14
00:54:05,454 --> 00:54:11,454
Hansard and Irglová had previously performed music as the Swell Season,
and composed and performed the film's original songs.

15
00:57:57,272 --> 00:58:03,272
Once spent years in development with the Irish Film Board
and was made for a budget of €112,000.

16
01:01:49,090 --> 01:01:55,090
It was a commercial success, earning substantial per-screen box office
averages in the United States, and received acclaim from critics.

17
01:05:40,909 --> 01:05:46,909
It received awards including the 2007 Independent
Spirit Award for Best Foreign Film.

18
01:09:32,727 --> 01:09:38,727
Hansard and Irglová's song "Falling Slowly" won the 2008 Academy Award for Best Original Song (making Irglova the youngest
person to win an Oscar in a non-acting category), and the soundtrack received a Grammy Award nomination.

19
01:13:24,545 --> 01:13:30,545
The film has also been adapted into a successful stage musical.

20
01:17:16,363 --> 01:17:22,363
The film explores themes of rock 'n' roll,
lovesickness, love of one's life, composer, pop.

21
01:21:08,181 --> 01:21:14,181
The tone is emotional.
